# Allied 3 (ALL03U, Hail to the Chief) won by lanes P22 and P23 through the step server (ra2/tools/ra2_step.py,
# ra2/tools/ra2_commander.py): P22's base (A3BASE1), GIs into two houses by the bridges, barracks, war factory and a
# pillbox, Grizzlies massed behind a home defence (ra2_commander.hold), then walked up the eastern road and round the north
# of the Soviet base in short legs with focus fire (ra2_commander.fight_along), and the Psychic Beacon force-fired by its
# cell (a click on the beacon itself is a move). Replayed by ra2/tests/ra2_campaign.py (missions 1-2 forced won). Inputs
# and ticks only; no game-event shortcut.
